  [MEDIUM] PE-SECTION-HIGH-ENTROPY  Executable section looks compressed or encrypted  (confidence: medium, packing)
      Section data has entropy >= 7.20 bits/byte. In code this means packed or encrypted instructions; in data sections it is often just compressed resources (images, archives), hence lower severity there.
