  [MEDIUM] PE-SECTION-RWX  Writable and executable section  (confidence: medium, anomaly)
      A section that is both writable and executable lets code modify itself in place, typical of packers, self-decrypting loaders and shellcode stubs. Normal compilers keep code read-only.
      - section #0 "UPX0"
